# Deploy to WoW AddOns

After creating or updating any addon file (`.lua`, `.toc`, `.xml`, textures), copy **only addon-related files** into:

`C:\Program Files (x86)\World of Warcraft\_retail_\Interface\AddOns\LaggyAddonDetector\`

Do not copy `.cursor`, rules, git metadata, or other project files.

Use overwrite copy so the in-game addon stays in sync without asking.
